                <p>Mandate issued May 4, 1931, not printed; see memorandum by the Minister in China,
                    May 4, <ref target="#pg837">p. 837</ref>, and telegram of May 5 from the
                    Minister, <ref target="#pg838">p. 838</ref>.</p>
            </note>
